## Interface: 16001
## Title: Quest Rank
## Notes: Keeps the quests you're working on at the top of the quest tracker and tracks every quest with recent activity until the tracker is full, and can follow the top one with the map arrow. Alt-click a quest's title to pin it to the top.
## Version: 0.1.0
## Dependencies: Everlook, EverlookPreferences, EverlookQA
## Group: Everlook
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Everlook\assets\logo.tga

quest_rank.lua
